[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969962575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104383#issuecomment-2969962575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104383","id":2969962575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xBghP","user":{"login":"vagran","id":6065976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNjU5NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6065976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran","html_url":"https://github.com/vagran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T10:57:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T10:57:29Z","body":"Encountered this as well when just started to evaluate Godot for my next project. Looks like a real show-stopper for me. Fortunately, I have found a workaround for my pipeline. I use this method to patch `AnimationPlayer` node in my glTF import script to remove tracks with a single key at time zero:\n\n```cs\nprivate static void _FixAnimations(AnimationPlayer player)\n{\n    var lib = player.GetAnimationLibrary(\"\");\n    foreach (var animationName in lib.GetAnimationList()) {\n        var animation = lib.GetAnimation(animationName);\n        var numTracks = animation.GetTrackCount();\n        for (var trackIdx = 0; trackIdx < numTracks; trackIdx++) {\n            if (animation.TrackGetKeyCount(trackIdx) != 1 ||\n                animation.TrackGetKeyTime(trackIdx, 0) != 0) {\n\n                continue;\n            }\n            animation.RemoveTrack(trackIdx);\n            trackIdx--;\n            numTracks--;\n        }\n    }\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969962575/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161559234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104383#issuecomment-3161559234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104383","id":3161559234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68cZDC","user":{"login":"Berkru","id":49285088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Mjg1MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49285088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru","html_url":"https://github.com/Berkru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Berkru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T20:47:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T20:47:29Z","body":"Getting the same problem over here Godot is adding a track with a key to objects, when it shouldn't. any expectation for solving this in near future?","author_association":"NO